  "bio": "Harisumi is an exceptionally skilled tattoo artist, mastering a range of styles including Japanese, traditional, and illustrative. With a career that spans over three decades, they've left a mark on the industry with their renowned craftsmanship and now bring their expertise to Honolulu, United States, through their proud ownership of @oldironsidetattoo and @harisumitattoostudio. Harisumi's dedication to the art of tattooing is evident in every piece they create, making them a sought-after artist in the tattoo community.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Honolulu, Hawaii, United States",
